<title>USA: Environmental Elements says J. Sinclair CFO.</title>
<headline>Environmental Elements says J. Sinclair CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Elements Corp said Wednesday it named James Sinclair chief financial officer.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said he replaced Brad Smith.</p>
<p>Sinclair was formerly the CFO of RWD Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Environmental Elements is a provider of air pollution control systems.</p>
